{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2026-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1790812800, "end_date": 1793491199, "month_true_total": 6, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:50:04 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "236608031", "author": {"steamid": "76561199739965025", "personaname": "ICY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199739965025/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11508, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 6640, "playtime_at_review": 11508, "last_played": 1790844389, "avatar": "658fbf2d5ba124e6d7b53f3201f9ebcc5ec86c4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "PEAK", "timestamp_created": 1790847070, "timestamp_updated": 1790847070, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236604284", "author": {"steamid": "76561199858549422", "personaname": "super_wasabi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199858549422/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7529, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 513, "playtime_at_review": 7529, "last_played": 1790839431, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have 1700 hours on PS5. This game has turned into a funnel to its trade market where good power items go for about 100-450 USD each (RNG lottery).  If you're the type of person who wants to have max / near max builds stay away from this game.  Combat is decent fun but gets boring fast, maps are empty and sterile.", "timestamp_created": 1790841544, "timestamp_updated": 1790841544, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236599462", "author": {"steamid": "76561198208537647", "personaname": "STRIZXY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198208537647/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 60143, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 7696, "playtime_at_review": 59573, "last_played": 1790868649, "avatar": "7b947a2c5485509554bcf91817e0382767505e94"}, "language": "english", "review": "endless content", "timestamp_created": 1790834544, "timestamp_updated": 1790834544, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236597527", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978567464", "personaname": "Broaddus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/therealbroaddus/", "num_games_owned": 426, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 5398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 36, "playtime_at_review": 5398, "last_played": 1790831430, "avatar": "c677b58d0fa95d6d822c348aefaf303592afd284"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is like Diablo and Destiny had a healthy badass baby.  Loot grind, over powered heroes, fun story.  It is all here in my opinion.  Definitely needs to you to dedicate the days if you want to reap the check in rewards, but it does offer dedicated paths to grind the equipment and loot you need to advance your build.", "timestamp_created": 1790831574, "timestamp_updated": 1790831574, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236593643", "author": {"steamid": "76561198285754241", "personaname": "Bino", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zealotsofstockhom/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 77, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 77, "last_played": 1722228380, "avatar": "f49757ecfeba66bd83fc39bf831d711517242a4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "goonslop", "timestamp_created": 1790825686, "timestamp_updated": 1790825686, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "236591847", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070325355", "personaname": "Ravi", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070325355/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 15862, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 358, "playtime_at_review": 15862, "last_played": 1790779231, "avatar": "f0daf639b9c36a9826159f5d53239f8bc82e13f5"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you've played and did everything in games like Warframe, Destiny 2, or Far Far West, then you should try TFD because it's free.\r\n\r\nA few months ago, they made a lot of weapons and Descendants require Archive Shards, which massively reduced the grind of the game, and they introduced timed events that give a lot of gold and kuiper (which is used for upgrading mods) to all players. So they've been making good changes and seem desperate to attract new players. But, overall, the game isn't particularly interesting nor fun. In every mission you will either have 1 or more team-mates that can massively overpower all enemies and are running at the speed of light, or you will have a team of 4 under-geared players who will be killed by the boss at the end and gain nothing. You can copy the builds of the highest ranked players in the leaderboards, but there's not a lot of build diversity, so it's hard to make something that feels like it fits your playstyle in particular and you may not understand the build that you copied from the veteran players. The story is nonsensical and the voice acting is generic.\r\n\r\nTFD feels too shallow right now. But I hope that the devs will figure out how to make the game fun, at some point in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1790823320, "timestamp_updated": 1790823320, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}]}